{"about_the_game":"Mystical Sovereign Z is a handcrafted indie strategy game. The game consists of two parts: turn based campaign and real time battles. Both parts are based on controlling characters that can be manually customized.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real time battles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lead your armies in real time battles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Give orders to troops in squads, controlling their movement, formation and behaviour</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manually control individual characters</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn based strategy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lead your forces on the campaign</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Recruit and manage characters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Assign army and squad leaders that give benefits to the troops they command</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Attack and capture enemy provinces and manage your own provinces</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take care of the economy</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All characters can be customized</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Characters have levels, which increase with their experience and have skills that can be increased</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different equipment and weapons can be purchased and assigned to each character, giving different benefits</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choices matter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Control the Imperial army on a frontier planet and defeat the rebels at any cost</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Various choices on the campaign that affect the story</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple endings based on choices</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196980?t=1728656273","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1728656273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196980/809349d2f